ge.\r\n195:asks = \"\"\"Does this need a measurable bound on speed, size, provider usage or operator time? If yes, what is the budget, under which conditions is it measured, and what happens when it is exceeded?\"\"\"\r\n199:# surface's priority and ONE surface's conditions; MAINTAINER reaches\r\n207:# the surface examples above describe the original finding, not its full scope.\r\ndocs/log.d/retired/LLR-297.md\ndocs/log.d/retired/TC-312.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
